      "source_section": "Sympathetic Nerve Blocks 2026 (July) / INDICATIONS",
      "source_quote": "General Indications: Acute or chronic noncancer pain causing functional disability or average pain level of ≥ 6 on a scale of 0 to 10 prior to injection... Cancer pain affecting quality of life... Each block must be performed under image guidance... Bilateral blocks will not be performed on the same day of service.",
      "clinical_service_or_procedure": "Sympathetic Nerve Blocks 2026 (July)",
      "rule_type": "clinical_indication",
      "conditions": {
